                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="370 1334 370 1349 2134 1349 2135 1334 2135 1305 2100 1293 2098 1293 2096 1293 2003 1303 1983 1293 1981 1293 1980 1293 1837 1303 1812 1293 1810 1293 1808 1293 1631 1303 1566 1293 1564 1293 1562 1293 1529 1303 1485 1293 1483 1293 1481 1293 1479 1293 1463 1305 896 1305 853 1293 851 1293 849 1293 662 1303 537 1293 535 1293 533 1293 504 1303 411 1293 409 1293 407 1293 370 1303 370 1334"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of his family get ready to go away as ransom. In this way, bloodshed might"/>
                    </TextLine>

