                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="366 1755 366 1768 2130 1763 2132 1747 2128 1718 1935 1708 1933 1708 1931 1708 1929 1708 1913 1720 1775 1720 1750 1708 1748 1708 1746 1708 1674 1720 1373 1710 1371 1710 1256 1720 1182 1712 1180 1712 1179 1712 1157 1722 956 1712 954 1712 952 1712 919 1722 884 1712 882 1712 880 1712 800 1724 530 1714 528 1714 364 1724 366 1755"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="a sound thrashing; and, since the girl scratched like a cat, they swaddled her"/>
                    </TextLine>

