                            <Polygon POINTS="366 1932 366 1944 2130 1946 2134 1926 2128 1887 2081 1897 1738 1887 1736 1887 1582 1897 1553 1887 1551 1887 1549 1887 1465 1899 1235 1889 1233 1889 1231 1889 1206 1899 1161 1889 1159 1889 1157 1889 1124 1899 1069 1889 1067 1889 947 1901 884 1891 882 1891 625 1901 533 1891 531 1891 530 1891 528 1891 512 1903 364 1903 366 1932"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="over. The ravished beauty already had two children, and lived by herself"/>
                    </TextLine>

